title: The Trial of Eugen Leviné
subtitle: A Munich court-martial wants a head.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1919 and month = 6 and crisis = 0 and bavaria_soviet = 1 and bav_power != 2 and levine_alive = 1
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
RG.arrest('levine', 0, {news: 'Eugen Leviné before a Munich court-martial', priority: 2});
!}

= The Trial of Eugen Leviné

[? if levine_escape = 1 : The false passport was not enough. ?] Leviné was found in a Munich flat in mid-May and brought before a court-martial for high treason. Toller and Mühsam will get prison. The court wants one man to die, and it has chosen the Russian Jew who led the Executive Council.

Leviné does not plead for his life. "We Communists are all dead men on leave," he tells the judges. [? if bav_negotiated = 1 : The surrender of 1 May promised courts, not firing squads. ?]

- @campaign: Strikes and protests across Germany to save him.
- @lawyers: Fight it in the higher courts.
- @speech: Let him speak, and print every word.

@campaign
subtitle: [? if bav_negotiated = 1 : With the terms of the surrender behind us, the protests may well work. ?][? if bav_negotiated = 0 : Levi doubts that Munich will bend to strikes in Berlin. ?]
on-arrival: {!
var chance = 0.2 + (Q.bav_negotiated ? 0.35 : 0) + Q.worker_support / 200;
Q.levine_alive = Math.random() < chance ? 1 : 0;
Q.militancy += 4;
Q.lean_offensive += 1;
!}
go-to: verdict

@lawyers
subtitle: [? if bav_negotiated = 1 : The court may have had no right to try him under the terms. A good chance. ?][? if bav_negotiated = 0 : Without the terms, the lawyers have very little to argue with. ?]
on-arrival: {!
var chance = 0.1 + (Q.bav_negotiated ? 0.45 : 0);
Q.levine_alive = Math.random() < chance ? 1 : 0;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 1;
!}
go-to: verdict

@speech
subtitle: Leviné's own choice. He will die, and the speech will be read for decades.
on-arrival: levine_alive = 0; worker_support += 4; lean_offensive += 1
go-to: verdict

@verdict
title: The Verdict
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.levine_alive) {
    RG.news('Leviné\'s death sentence commuted to fifteen years\' fortress', 3);
} else {
    RG.kill('levine', {news: 'Leviné shot in Stadelheim: "Long live the world revolution"', priority: 3});
    RG.ledger('Eugen Leviné was shot in Munich on 5 June 1919.', 'e19_levine_shot');
}
!}

= The Verdict

[? if levine_alive = 1 : The sentence is commuted to fifteen years' fortress. Leviné is taken to Niederschönenfeld, where Toller and Mühsam will join him. ?][? if levine_alive = 0 : On 5 June Leviné is shot in the yard of Stadelheim prison, crying "Long live the world revolution!" His speech to the court is printed illegally in a hundred thousand copies. ?]
